---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
# Canonicalise to the .it primary: the .com alias 301s across (host-matched), so
# the site lives at one domain with no duplicate-content ambiguity. These must
# stay above the path-only rules below, or the /* 404 would catch .com first.
https://robertopianastudio.com/*      https://robertopianastudio.it/:splat  301!
https://www.robertopianastudio.com/*  https://robertopianastudio.it/:splat  301!
https://rpdesigngroup.com/*         https://robertopianastudio.it/:splat  301!

# The CMS lives only at /admin. Send the language-prefixed guess there.
# Forced (!) so it wins over the physical fallback page + the /en 404 below.
/en/admin/*  /admin/  301!
/en/admin    /admin/  301!

# Legacy rpdesigngroup.com paths. These still rank in Google (la-storia, contattaci,
# commerciale/showroom, chi-siamo/il-team) and the .com blanket-301s to this domain's ROOT,
# so the old deep links lose their target. Map each to its nearest surviving page instead of
# letting the /* rule below serve a 404 — that is what carries the ranking across.
/la-storia            /studio/    301
/chi-siamo/il-team    /studio/    301
/chi-siamo/*          /studio/    301
/contattaci           /contatti/  301
/commerciale/showroom /contatti/  301

# Language-aware 404. Existing files take precedence, so these only fire for
# unmatched paths. Specific rule first.
/en/*  /en/404.html  404
/*     /404.html      404
